message: "If you use these skills, please cite them using the metadata below."
title: Australian Accounting Skills
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Duguid
    given-names: Ryan
abstract: >-
  Nine preparation-only agent skills for Australian public-practice
  accounting workflows, with source verification, reconciliation checks and
  human review boundaries. This record is pinned to the tagged v0.1.5
  release, the nine-skill practice pack. The nineteen-skill v0.2.0 release
  of 2 September 2026 added the ten contracting workflows; cite that tag
  when relying on them. The sixty-three-skill v0.3.0 release of
  29 September 2026 added 43 Australian preparation workflows and one
  financial modelling workflow. Cite that tag when relying on them. The
  development branch has sixty-five skills with a client acceptance
  workflow and a working holiday maker workflow. This citation still identifies v0.1.5.
version: 0.1.5
